{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a74bb78a95caea8e315c5707de3b1066b8708cc5621dd9ff9a3bff4b8a7dda07", "ja": "（今日は、『聖ミリオン女学園』の撮影。\n琴葉達、ロータス姉妹が誕生するシーンだ……）", "zh": "（今天是《圣百万女学园》的拍摄。是琴叶她们饰演的莲花姐妹诞生的场景……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1029_p", "source_sha256": "44dc6fcdff381f056443316fc2538261cc9f433ab146a8a40cd20856eecea43d", "ja": "（劇中で、琴葉は演劇の衣装合わせをしている。\nそこに静香が、妹候補の伊織を連れてきた……）", "zh": "（在剧中，琴叶正在试穿演剧服装。静香带着作为妹妹候选人的伊织来到了那里……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "b57a10411212244c173782fba9a63d5f1ae064d753390dd31b64384ab11012a1", "ja": "静香さん。それが、貴女の答えなの？", "zh": "静香，这就是你的答案吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "eb314dc71a0df143ed5bac6a287ecad879a1b213a8f7680c9e13493602fdffef", "ja": "は、はいっ！　……私は、\nここにいる水瀬伊織さんと、姉妹になります！", "zh": "是、是的！……我会和在这里的水濑伊织先生结为姐妹！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "2d3662568c39a9cd3b515a1ea25b2d6eb851c613f7f53d6b5394bcc7933adc9e", "ja": "それを、お姉さまに認めていただきたいんです！\nあの、どうか許可を……！", "zh": "我想得到姐姐的认可！\n那个，求您批准……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "d2844a41df22df1af6f691790cfbc900532453c266e586d1053cb10f4fd87387", "ja": "認める？　……静香さんが選んだ人ですもの。\n私に、何か言う権利なんてないと思うのだけれど。", "zh": "认可？……毕竟是静香小姐选中的人。\n我觉得自己没有什么资格说三道四。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "b15d2ce46153c7f910e35db82f97806c8e22da6b1268087bc3b240d031c4911b", "ja": "ち、違いますわ！\n私が、誰よりもミス・ロータスに認めてほしいんです！", "zh": "不、不是的！  \n我想得到Miss Lotus的认可，胜过任何人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "0b790d7ef67a28176304f0eaaa178ec0874293d887f4f93f1d274cd1b6644b80", "ja": "私、最初に誤ちに気づかせてくれた貴女のこと、\nフェンシング部の部員として、心から尊敬しています。", "zh": "我打心底里敬佩你——是你第一个让我意识到自己的错误，\n作为击剑部的部员，我由衷地尊敬你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "4d06e7dc28bcd1b6706b2c5b5546548e5d65b6a7e47c003e4f63363574d89096", "ja": "けど……素直に受け止められなかった私に、\n粘り強く接してくれたのは、静香お姉さまで……。", "zh": "可是……对没能坦率接受这一切的我，一直耐心对待的，是静香姐姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "dfa37aaf38448d32ea5422635c69b3500f3600844be13d4198f59f8af2bcd087", "ja": "伊織さん……。", "zh": "伊织……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "1f4bfdb62aa97435faf64f922c4ffd6fdb832f61df812d740f369d64caf63fb9", "ja": "私は、独りよがりでなく……私自身や、静香お姉さまが\n尊敬する貴女に、妹として認められたいんです！", "zh": "我不是为了自我满足……而是想被我自己和静香姐姐都尊敬的您认可为妹妹！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "2534f34e50ca4aa3bc67058036c6a342d7a15c11a2795119101f9e23216805ff", "ja": "そうね。そこまで言うのなら……\n私と勝負なさい、伊織さん。", "zh": "是啊。既然你都这么说了……就来和我一决胜负吧，伊织小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "437d442b0cb823786487c18f77024891ca79821e051194b023c077536c539dfa", "ja": "貴女の剣が、あの時と違うかどうか……\n『妹を守る姉』の私が、見てあげましょう。", "zh": "你的剑是否和那时不同……就让我这个‘保护妹妹的姐姐’来确认一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2343b08cac7def0bf5970512950be0879d220abf1d29a2783238a0f3f7aed17a", "ja": "お疲れさま！　3人とも、熱演だったな。", "zh": "辛苦了！3个人的精彩演出都很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "63ccb4bc35dbceed9a973be751e625f88a8a2152e3dbaa82dc071f09175121cd", "ja": "お疲れさまです、琴葉さん！\nあの、これ、タオルです！　使ってください！", "zh": "辛苦了，琴叶！\n那个，这条毛巾给你！请用吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "a10aa14f103e35f0c2d6ac725423061eb159d90596c4814c9e854bafac4ad759", "ja": "ありがとう、静香さん。……あ、ごめんなさい。\n静香ちゃん、だよね。つい役柄と混ざっちゃうな。", "zh": "谢谢你，静香小姐。……啊，对不起。\n应该是静香才对呢。不知不觉就和角色搞混了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "cd2d81d0c31ae789f1a969eefd9675852b22efa482154d19ce4d50894249d23d", "ja": "それくらい、役に入りこめてるってことでしょ？\nだったらいいんじゃないかしら。", "zh": "能入戏到这种程度，不正说明很投入吗？\n那样的话，不也挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "98ef3d07134ed580a99fa6d0246c9bcf847434d3b416b7812420b96dbc0d1a62", "ja": "ありがとう、伊織ちゃん。\nそう言ってもらえると、うれしいな♪", "zh": "谢谢你，伊织。\n你能这么说，我很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "b853f48435aa5d013a6845199bfedb587d67149443f344c999512bb30c7ca9d9", "ja": "けど、どうして私が1年生で静香が2年生なのかしら？\n私のほうが年上なのに……。", "zh": "可是，为什么我是1年生，而静香是2年生呢？\n明明我年纪更大……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "eae05c49d71fe252fb38b47a83dee71f62990fa901279b5610a85360210cfb44", "ja": "そ、そうですね。私も{$P$}に\n聞いたんですけど、配役は決まってるからって……。", "zh": "是、是这样。我也问过{$P$}先生，但他说角色安排已经定下来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b69d4e03d8030839db47371fe23f5aefb47b84e1ca50551223c28dfbce36c286", "ja": "配役は、監督やスポンサーの意向もあるからな。\n俺だけで決められないんだよ。", "zh": "选角还要考虑导演和赞助商的意向。不是我一个人能决定的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "2c1c9ef1408fbf37cdb4840ccd7ec2451176b448d233279f101daee1942501cc", "ja": "けど私は、ピッタリだと思ったけどな？\nふたりの役。", "zh": "不过我觉得，真的是再合适不过了啊？\n这两个角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "db9b727fe13c28e5a13674c14578797df4d9ad6047f41756b28d881afca962b1", "ja": "真面目で優しい静香ちゃんと、最初はすこし\n生意気だけど、素直でまっすぐな伊織ちゃん……。", "zh": "认真又温柔的静香，以及一开始有点任性、但坦率又直率的伊织……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "14d3890f43753f7acb55988ed484ddfb36d50b20e9f0823ee27a806c0d69bda2", "ja": "どちらも役柄だけど、ふたりの面影を感じるもの。\nだから私も、自然に演じられるんだと思う。", "zh": "虽然都是角色设定，却都能让人感受到她们两人的影子。\n所以我想，我也能很自然地演绎出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "9dfb50f0e6e5413b3277c1ad86385127c2b68eb1df425657ee92b4e3eab95907", "ja": "琴葉さん……！", "zh": "琴叶……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1026_007ior", "source_sha256": "aa674c5adab4a57334d265876fd6fd873cffccf16c1882cc08a2eae990c8291a", "ja": "まあ、けっこう面白い役だったし。たまには、\n先輩を慕う後輩役っていうのも、悪くないわね♪", "zh": "不过，那个角色还挺有意思的。偶尔演演仰慕前辈的后辈角色，也不错嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "f1ae773f1ff36f576087028b5c83f67a7ae3a3ff14382eda9b4b7f2867d74080", "ja": "今回は負けだったけど……次にフェンシングシーンが\nあったら、絶対負けないわよ。覚悟しなさいよね♪", "zh": "这次虽然输了……但下次要是还有击剑戏，我绝对不会再输了。做好觉悟吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0204_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "f050c77535f97ab1354177133d854f1fd894fd7d7dd065cfbee8a8e2f82c0a25", "ja": "ええ、もちろん！　また3人で、ロータス姉妹を\n演じられるよう、残りの撮影もがんばろうね♪", "zh": "当然啦！为了下次还能以3人一起演绎莲花姐妹，剩下的拍摄也要加油哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
